            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "digging",
            "ref": "v-dig"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " out “cultural relics” by yourself at home? With museum "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "blind boxes",
            "zh": "盲盒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", you can do just that!"
