      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These boxes are “blind” because you can’t see what’s inside until you open them. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " It’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hidden",
            "ref": "v-hide"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " under the "
