          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "soil",
            "zh": "土壤"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The box "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "comes with",
            "zh": "附带"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a digging "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tool",
            "ref": "v-tool"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and a small "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "brush",
            "ref": "v-brush"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for you to use. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Then, you can use the brush to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sweep",
            "ref": "v-sweep"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the soil away."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Museum blind boxes can be found at museum gift shops and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "online stores",
            "ref": "v-online-store"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“When I was digging, I felt like a real "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "archaeologist",
            "zh": "考古学家"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!” said one buyer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
